    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "femtorv32_quark.v",
      "source_hash": 15603131674301222675,
      "context_hash": 12286390015132871709,
      "translation": "femtorv32_quark.v",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32I",
      "source_hash": 16459296673051770446,
      "context_hash": 16748147718297043867,
      "translation": "RV32I",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The smallest core in this collection, perfect for tiny FPGAs.",
      "source_hash": 13395300171776306212,
      "context_hash": 15831883027234315904,
      "translation": "이 모음에서 가장 작은 코어로, 소형 FPGA에 안성맞춤입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "For size reasons, it shifts only one bit per clock cycle.",
      "source_hash": 7845725260403011842,
      "context_hash": 12341200308186811192,
      "translation": "크기를 줄이기 위해 클록 사이클당 1비트씩만 시프트합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "femtorv32_quark_bicycle.v",
      "source_hash": 17468549836915275252,
      "context_hash": 17578097288105610874,
      "translation": "femtorv32_quark_bicycle.v",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32I",
      "source_hash": 16459296673051770446,
      "context_hash": 18210479682718766621,
      "translation": "RV32I",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "The simplest and fastest - in terms of cycles/instruction - core in this collection.",
      "source_hash": 18342136696525742256,
      "context_hash": 16085176558418286732,
      "translation": "이 모음에서 가장 단순하고, 명령어당 사이클 수 기준으로 가장 빠른 코어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "Basically Quark with a barrel shifter and additional multiplexers.",
      "source_hash": 1060208698407730880,
      "context_hash": 15982685570140611979,
      "translation": "기본적으로 Quark에 배럴 시프터와 추가 멀티플렉서를 더한 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:2",
      "source": "Recommended if you can afford a few more LUTs and just need a vanilla RV32I.",
      "source_hash": 6793097531909175483,
      "context_hash": 15228138904224749599,
      "translation": "LUT를 몇 개 더 쓸 여유가 있고 기본 RV32I만 필요하다면 이 코어를 권장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497870Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "femtorv32_tachyon.v",
      "source_hash": 8495989424095010527,
      "context_hash": 1634135628926381251,
      "translation": "femtorv32_tachyon.v",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32I",
      "source_hash": 16459296673051770446,
      "context_hash": 12941157605578307939,
      "translation": "RV32I",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Quark with execute cycle split in two in order to achieve a higher maximum clock frequency, but at the expense of more cycles per instruction.",
      "source_hash": 7773228845404681740,
      "context_hash": 9648808582796860822,
      "translation": "더 높은 최대 클록 주파수를 달성하려고 실행 사이클을 둘로 나눈 Quark이지만, 그 대가로 명령어당 사이클 수가 늘어납니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "femtorv32_electron.v",
      "source_hash": 11515278312680501158,
      "context_hash": 12525388228967072766,
      "translation": "femtorv32_electron.v",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32IM",
      "source_hash": 17938990540228209326,
      "context_hash": 6326009632508342697,
      "translation": "RV32IM",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Featuring barrel shifter, multiplication and division instructions.",
      "source_hash": 10255328712908333256,
      "context_hash": 3285988746340915233,
      "translation": "배럴 시프터와 곱셈 및 나눗셈 명령어를 갖추고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "femtorv32_intermissum.v",
      "source_hash": 13372752443637553739,
      "context_hash": 12647770897157074430,
      "translation": "femtorv32_intermissum.v",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32IM + IRQ",
      "source_hash": 7718314855495259166,
      "context_hash": 17878541852837361534,
      "translation": "RV32IM + IRQ",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "Full interrupt support along with CSR registers.",
      "source_hash": 16297631095981292891,
      "context_hash": 442649320126454429,
      "translation": "CSR 레지스터와 함께 인터럽트를 완전히 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "femtorv32_gracilis.v",
      "source_hash": 11874202568563963738,
      "context_hash": 9333723234189854057,
      "translation": "femtorv32_gracilis.v",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32IMC + IRQ",
      "source_hash": 10577716527946625081,
      "context_hash": 12121104364229667896,
      "translation": "RV32IMC + IRQ",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "With compressed instructions support, saves both RAM usage and memory fetch cycles.",
      "source_hash": 3279662024058044963,
      "context_hash": 10656924446283442859,
      "translation": "압축 명령어를 지원하므로 RAM 사용량과 메모리 페치 사이클을 모두 줄여 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:23/seg:1",
      "source": "Recommended as general-purpose processor.",
      "source_hash": 4374359407878749402,
      "context_hash": 15691783994645782451,
      "translation": "범용 프로세서로 권장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "femtorv32_individua.v",
      "source_hash": 9074522349163655058,
      "context_hash": 12445328573470850027,
      "translation": "femtorv32_individua.v",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "RV32IMAC + IRQ",
      "source_hash": 16249941105713399579,
      "context_hash": 7205209851674115905,
      "translation": "RV32IMAC + IRQ",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "Also available with atomic instructions support.",
      "source_hash": 1169460723457483645,
      "context_hash": 2318422384470442720,
      "translation": "원자적 명령어를 지원하는 버전도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:26/seg:1",
      "source": "Not really necessary in single processor designs, but probably useful if you have tricky interrupt handlers.",
      "source_hash": 15689912122521604631,
      "context_hash": 14300248892116626805,
      "translation": "단일 프로세서 설계에서는 꼭 필요하지 않지만, 까다로운 인터럽트 핸들러가 있다면 유용할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:07:46.497871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
